@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> ParametersConfiguring : openReportingDashboard()

ParametersConfiguring --> AggregatingData : generateReport(type, startDate, endDate)\n[startDate <= endDate]
AggregatingData --> ParametersConfiguring : [no matching records found]\n/ notifyEmptyDataset()

AggregatingData --> Generated : [records > 0]\n/ computeKPIs() & saveSnapshot()
Generated --> Exported : exportReport(format="PDF/CSV")
Exported --> Generated : viewReport()

Generated --> ArchivedReport : archiveReport(reportId)
Exported --> ArchivedReport : archiveReport(reportId)
ArchivedReport --> [*]
@enduml